<title>NEW ZEALAND: National's Neeson confirmed winner in Waipareira.</title>
<headline>National's Neeson confirmed winner in Waipareira.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Party's Brian Neeson was on Wednesday confirmed as winner of the Waipareira seat, the returning officer said.</p>
<p>On election night, Neeson led Labour's Chris Carter by 10,948 votes to 10,807.  </p>
<p>After special votes were counted, Neeson had 12,123 votes to Carter's 12,016.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
